|  |                                                 (Implicit Trust Granted) |  |
|  +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  * Flaw: Once perimeter is breached, lateral movement is unrestricted.      |
|                                                                             |
|  [ Zero Trust Micro-Segmentation Architecture ]                             |
|  +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
