|            |                              |                 & Authenticates
|            |                              |                            |
|            |                              |              5. Generates Response
|            |                              |                            |
|            |                              | <--- 6. Encoded SAML Resp -|
|            | <--- 6. Sends SAML Response -|                            |
|            |                              |                            |
