|         v                                                 |                 |
|  [ End User / Browser ]                                [ Relying Party ]    |
|         |                                                 ^                 |
|         | 3. Redirect to IdP                               |                 |
|         |                                                 | 2. Shared       |
|         v                                                 |    Secret       |
